end(userId:String, reservationId:Long)
:Rental

1) find rental by user and reservationID or raise an error
2) get the Reservation from the RS by reservationId
3) if the reservation endData is not today, create new 
InvoiceAdjust entity with updated price and endDate (today)
4) send the InvoiceUpdate to the "invoice-adjust" channel
5) deactivate the Rental and set today as the end day. Persist it</y:NodeLabel>
                      <y:StyleProperties>
