                      <y:NodeLabel alignment="left" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="12" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" height="167.44114303588867" horizontalTextPosition="center" iconTextGap="4" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#000000" verticalTextPosition="bottom" visible="true" width="388.9266357421875" x="5.0" xml:space="preserve" y="5.0">POST /reservation
make(reservation:Reservation):Reservation

1) get userId from the SecurityContext
2) add the userId to the Reservation received in POST
3) save the reservation to the Reservation Repository
4) create an Invoice DTO with the Reservation and calculate price
5) send the Invoice to the RabbitMQ queue "invoices"
6) if the reservation.startDate is TODAY, start the rental (call the RES)
7) return the reservation with userId</y:NodeLabel>
                      <y:StyleProperties>
                        <y:Property class="com.yworks.yfiles.bpmn.view.TaskTypeEnum" name="com.yworks.bpmn.taskType" value="TASK_TYPE_RECEIVE"/>
